# API Catalogue (Backend) — par module & sous-module

> Base path: **/api** (monté dans `backend/src/server.js`)
> Auth: la plupart des routes utilisent `authMiddleware` et/ou `permissionMiddleware(...)`

---

## 1) Auth

- **POST** `/api/auth/login` — (loginValidator) 
- **GET** `/api/auth/me` — `authMiddleware`
- **POST** `/api/auth/logout` — `authMiddleware`

---

## 2) Permissions & Roles (RBAC)

### 2.1 Permissions
- **GET** `/api/permissions` — `permissionMiddleware('permissions.view')`

### 2.2 Roles
- **GET** `/api/roles` — `permissionMiddleware('roles.view')`
- **POST** `/api/roles` — `permissionMiddleware('roles.create')` (createRoleValidator)
- **GET** `/api/roles/:id` — `permissionMiddleware('roles.view')`
- **PUT** `/api/roles/:id` — `permissionMiddleware('roles.update')` (updateRoleValidator)
- **DELETE** `/api/roles/:id` — `permissionMiddleware('roles.delete')`
- **POST** `/api/roles/:id/permissions` — `permissionMiddleware('permissions.assign')`
- **GET** `/api/roles/:id/permissions` — `permissionMiddleware('permissions.view')`

---

